# GDPR Art.17 Erasure Runbook

**Project:** <%= projectName %>
**Generated:** <%- new Date().toISOString().split('T')[0] %>
**Regulation:** GDPR Art.17 — Right to Erasure ("Right to be Forgotten")

> **Usage:** Each step must be executed in order. Record the actor, timestamp,
> and outcome in the Acknowledgement column. Retain this completed runbook
> as compliance evidence.

---

## Scope

This runbook covers the complete cascade of deletion actions required when
an erasure request is received from a data subject. All systems that hold
personal data about the subject must be addressed.

**Trigger:** Data subject submits verified erasure request.
**SLA:** Completion within 30 calendar days (GDPR Art.17(1)).

---

