## Provenance

14-step cascade structure extracted from viafera codebase GDPR audit (2026).
Step 7 IDP hard-delete requirement is the key audit finding: many implementations
only disable the IDP account, leaving PII in the identity provider's database.
This runbook generalises to any project with a similar system footprint.
